OL,3,AWoman at centre of Cornell rape inquiry
OL,4,Awas 'failed' by officials, says New
OL,5,AYork governor
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt a news conference on Friday, Hochul
OL,8,Fsaid she was "deeply disturbed" by how
OL,9,Fthe investigation was handled. She has
OL,10,Fnow appointed New York Attorney General
OL,11,FLetitia James to lead the case.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
